# Source inputs for environments/requirements-demo.txt, the hash-pinned closure
# Dockerfile.demo installs. Regenerate with:
#   python tools/update_dependencies.py --all              (full re-lock)
#   python tools/update_dependencies.py --target PACKAGE   (bump one package)
#   Not reachable via --ci-env; requirements-demo.txt line 2 records the exact argv.
#
# Exactly the image's declared requirements: every [project].dependencies entry
# and the [demo] extra, each at the version requirements.txt pins (jsonschema at
# the version environments/requirements.lock resolves; streamlit, which neither
# carries, at its own pin), plus setuptools, the build backend for the image's
# --no-build-isolation installs of this lock and the package. Compiled for Python 3.13,
# the image's interpreter, with requirements.txt as uv's version preference
# (SEEDED_SPECS in tools/update_dependencies.py), so the transitive dependencies
# it shares with requirements.txt keep the versions CI tests.
# tests/test_images_install_only_hashed_dependencies.py enforces all of this.
